<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10900"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 08, 2005 - 2:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think his wife and children are using whatever they have avaible to stay sane, their lives must be like total living nightmare. <BR>If it was me I would be rolling/screeming/gurgling on the floor crying my eyes and heart out and end up in a paralyzed state of mind and body just asking somone to inject a lot of drugs so that i would feel/understand nothing... <BR>I mean this a a nightmare that will NOT go away, they know they will NOT wake up &#40;if Rader is the one and only BTK? cant help it&#41; this is their FATHER her HUSBAND not som evil stranger but the man they were raised by huged by and his wife was intim with arghhhhhh!!!!...wow just writing about it makes me feel sick... <BR>Please God help thise people, give them streghts to, in time, be able to go on with their lifes and beeing able to feel joy and love again, not blaming themselves for what their father and husband did...Amen...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10900-->
<!--Post: 10907--><!--Time: 1110290839-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10907"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Surfietx<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Surfietx<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 08, 2005 - 6:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yes, Skov.  I can only imagine the &#34;what if&#39;s&#34; that his family must be saying over and over in their minds.  So very sad. <BR> <BR>I wanted to add too that just because his immediate family was &#34;decent,&#34; that does not preclude abuse.  Much like Oprah and others, children are abused by other trusted adults.  I heard Denny&#39;s uncle was a real prize - spending quite a lot of time in prison for sexual abuse and whatnot. <BR> <BR>There is something there is his past that started the seed of evil.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10907-->
<!--Post: 10919--><!--Time: 1110303750-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10919"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lctrip<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lctrip<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 08, 2005 - 9:42 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ember &amp; Rocky - The original DNA match was from the medical tissue sample, was from before the arrest &#40;to determine that Rader was their man&#41;, and the daughter &#40;Kerri&#41; had no knowledge of it &#40;criminal investigation&#41;. <BR> <BR>What I&#39;ve read is that after the arrest on Friday the 25th they showed up at the daughter&#39;s apartment in Michigan and asked for a sample, using the angle that they needed it to rule out her father as a suspect.  She provided it and that was a match also. <BR> <BR>Really feel bad for her - she was away from her family when this whole thing went down and had to deal with it by herself. I&#39;m also sure she was getting besieged with a lot of information from various sources, and who knows how accurate it was.  And then to learn that it was her DNA, obtained without her permission, that closed the net on her Dad.....  Yes it was legal, yes her Dad may be &#40;probably is&#41; a horrible monster, but I imagine that has to be a real tough thing for her to handle.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10919-->
<!--Post: 11025--><!--Time: 1110369537-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11025"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Mel1pred<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Mel1pred<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 3:58 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->His wife had to have been a submissive person and they were all most probably victims of mental abuse by dtdc.  They are most certainly in shock still, and I would imagine feel some shame that it went on under thier noses undetected.  They are probably trying to peice it all together - just as we have been - I can imagine they are remembering things all the time that make them think in retrospect - why didn&#39;t I know!  They must be going through hell. <BR>I would think that if they didn&#39;t at least suspect now that he is truely btk they would have visited.  That&#39;s interesting that they have not.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11025-->
<!--Post: 11038--><!--Time: 1110385235-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11038"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 8:20 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->On the AMW site, a reference is made to a quote from Kerri&#39;s former boyfriend in which he stated that it was common knowledge in high school that her father was BTK. Her husband reported that every night she awoke screaming with nightmares. With years of BTK&#39;s silence, his family may have put to rest their conscious/unconscious suspicions about D. being BTK. Can you imagine their horror at his reemergence? <BR> <BR>He may have had a loving Marine father and mother in terms of the view from the birth order of the reporting brother, but first borns can have a different experience. I have known one Marine and it was not pleasant. I know a man whose father was a ship captain and he ran a very tight ship at home as well. Everything was black and white. That son had adjustment problems galore, and he sees everything in black and white, cannot get along with employers and coworkers, drugs, alcohol, fist fights, very controlling, hot temper, jealous, etc. <BR> <BR>Very submissive wives have often experienced brainwashing to some degree &#40;do not go off on me&#41;. I was one as well for 18 years. I was not allowed to vote on one occassion, drove a van that was making me sick and was told that it was my fault. I &#39;just could not take the summer heat&#39; &#40;no AC in summer and no heat in winter&#41;. Once I was receiving telephone harrassment and I was told that it was my fault because I said something that I did not say to someone when they were not there! If you can figure that one out, please respond. My behavior conformed so that I did not get in trouble and get yelled at. I was told that God&#39;s laws applied to me, but not to his high school girlfriend. WOW! To be worthey of an immaculate reception and a standing ovulation. Who knows what Paula went through. She put up a good front as well, living the mask of sanity as best she could. <BR> <BR>Until he has some psychiatric exams, no one is for sure how Rader was programmed. I am sure that he will try to scam the mental health professionals. And I would not want to talk to him as well. I think that they have done the right thing by keeping him at a great distance. They were his stage props to cover the killer that he is. He is responsible for the separation, not them. If I were Paula, I would feel so used and dirty.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11038-->
<!--Post: 11043--><!--Time: 1110387450-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11043"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Witchking<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Witchking<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 8:57 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I do not doubt the fear people like yourself and other women go through. It is well documented. I seriously doubt the AMW story about everyone knowing in high school. CERTAINLY that would have been followed up on. SOMEBODY would have checked that angle out. If not, wow, Wichita will just be broke due to the trillion dollar lawsuits should this suddenly become available as credible, which I doubt. <BR> <BR>Every family has secrets, some are more sinister than others. I mean I don&#39;t think ANY family would want their live opened to public scrutiny. <BR> <BR>Teardrop I empathize with you as a neighbor woman who lived next door to us was abused for years. Phone calls to police did nothing except after a while we fear meant worse beatings. This too was the 70&#39;s and attitudes and laws were much different. I have no doubt Paula feared this guy, until she says different we&#39;ll never know if she had suspicions. The worst part for the family IF they didn&#39;t know would be what we are all doing, wondering how close police were, what clues were missed, body language, a missed comment that now makes sense, the shed etc. I should imagine of they didn&#39;t know, the family if backtracking info times a hundered compared to the rest of us---being so close they&#39;ll always be like Charlie Otero who only wants to know &#34;Why my family&#34; they will forever live wirth &#34;How did we miss clues&#34;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11043-->
<!--Post: 11044--><!--Time: 1110388727-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11044"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:linnieskid@earthlink.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Linnieskid<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Linnieskid<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 9:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The family may have been asked to not contact him by the prosecution. This might have a psychological impact on him &#40;it has&#41; and Le  and the prosecution would have more leverage with him.  I.E, He believes he has no support, He can offer no explanations to his family, He can offer no apologies to his family, HE HAS NO  <BR>CONTROL, over his family. <BR> <BR>If I were the prosecution I would have asked the family to stay away for awhile.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11044-->
<!--Post: 11046--><!--Time: 1110389941-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11046"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bojo<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bojo<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 9:39 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The KAKE segment &#34;Rader&#39;s jail conditions&#34; infers that the family has not been allowed contact.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11046-->
<!--Post: 11047--><!--Time: 1110390114-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11047"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Mel1pred<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Mel1pred<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 9:41 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If I thought there was the slightest chance that my husband/father was innocent you couldnt keep me away!  And certainly not the prosecution.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11047-->
<!--Post: 11048--><!--Time: 1110390591-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11048"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:linnieskid@earthlink.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Linnieskid<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Linnieskid<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 9:49 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Mel 1pred:  Forgone conclusion.  My premise was based upon them believing that he committed the crimes.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11048-->
<!--Post: 11049--><!--Time: 1110390769-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11049"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:linnieskid@earthlink.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Linnieskid<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Linnieskid<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 9:52 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->...and what I would do as prosecution for psychological impact manipulation.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11049-->
<!--Post: 11051--><!--Time: 1110392663-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11051"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iceteajan<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iceteajan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 10:24 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I wonder if the family is also being questioned during their seclusion? <BR> <BR>For example:  Did they go on vacation &#40;possibly near a spot where some poor lady was mysteriously bound and strangled&#41;? <BR> <BR>If BALDY LOCKS continued his murderous spree, then perhaps there is a lot more they can learn from the family in terms of possible new victims. <BR> <BR>Perhaps his favorite dumping spot ...&#40;oops&#41;... &#34;fishing spot&#34; is of great value to LE?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11051-->
<!--Post: 11054--><!--Time: 1110395980-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11054"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:linnieskid@earthlink.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Linnieskid<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Linnieskid<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 11:19 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Baldy Locks, LOL <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11054-->
<!--Post: 11078--><!--Time: 1110417851-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11078"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:williammichael@direcway.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Oklahoma_mike<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Oklahoma_mike<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 5:24 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Witchking, I also am sceptical of the reports of classmates in high school talking about the Rader childrens&#39; dad and btk, and also of the reported blog by his son-in-law about the daughter having nightmares and fearing someone was breaking in the house to kill them.  The reason I am sceptical is the old saying that if something sounds too good to be true, it isn&#39;t.  The implications of such specific comments, if true, are among the most amazing things in this amazing case.   <BR>I am not accusing anyone of intentional falsification, but with the  reported source &#39;blogs&#39; now offline who knows how many hands the &#39;cached&#39; information has passed through or what the original source was? <BR>I do not know the law in terms of family visits in jail, I do not think the law can prevent all visits but can limit them to specific days and times.  We will see in the future if he has any support from his family or not. <BR>However, I also agree with all the posters who say that at least psychological abuse was heaped upon the family.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11078-->
<!--Post: 11112--><!--Time: 1110434831-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11112"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Angrywolf<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Angrywolf<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 10:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Maybe there&#39;s more than we know...if you go to Kansas.com and the discussion board there you can read a little about the blogs denny&#39;s daughter and son in law had....they had extensive blogs at one time..the son in law seemed to have written about everything..trips..vacations..holidays..his friends..family getogethers..the whole 9 yards...After denny&#39;s arrest they seemed to have frantically gone through and erased/deleted everything..but someone managed to copy some of the son in laws blog...and that&#39;s where it says she..denny&#39;s daughter..screams at night..yep..she wakes up screaming at night believing someone is trying to kill her....if this is true..and I have no way to confirm it....it could well be a hoax.....maybe Tom will have some ideas as I passed it on to the authorities in Wichita after I read it...yes..I passed it on..because I was concerned that denny may have molested his own daughter..that she might be repressing the memory..so I passed it on to them...let them investigate and see if it is true or false....maybe it isn&#39;t true..maybe it is but has another cause..but I felt it should be looked into so I passed it on...I just felt suspicious that a young woman would wake up screaming at night..and her hubby would have to move to the couch to get a good night&#39;s sleep...when we know so many unsavory things have gone on with denny... <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11112-->
<!--Post: 11113--><!--Time: 1110435038-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11113"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Angrywolf<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Angrywolf<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 09, 2005 - 10:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->as far as being suspicious..let the authorities investigate and we&#39;ll hear sooner or later if it is true or not true...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11113-->
<!--Post: 11135--><!--Time: 1110463105-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11135"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 5:58 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The high school rumor may have been one of many that go around. &#34;Her dad is so wierd, he must be BTK&#34;, and it was left at that It is probably correct to believe that his family is being debriefed as well. With prodding, they might recall something. You can be assured that they relive their lives with him several times a day, wondering what they could have missed that was right under their noses. Kerri&#39;s dreams indicate some connection with his killings on some subconscious level. Maybe she is gifted/cursed with some form of second sight, or whatever one calls it. Maybe Paula has kept a journal all these years, as many people do.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11135-->
<!--Post: 11136--><!--Time: 1110463773-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11136"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Witchking<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Witchking<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 10, 2005 - 6:09 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think the High School rumor mill is as bad as the work rumor mill. Gary Ridgeway I learned from watching my good friend television was so odd at his job they actually called him Green River Gary behind his back....Um, uh wait, ok <BR> <BR>OK, so the high school rumors are true ;&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
